ary, syntaxes and spelling .", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling .", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling .", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling .", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling .", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling .", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling .", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "frn5le09ob08re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Compte rendu d'un accident", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Pour faire un compte rendu, l'auteur doit raconter les faits exactement comme il les a observ\u00e9s.  ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Il faut employer : <ul><li><span class=\"strong\"> l'imparfait</span> pour d\u00e9crire la <span class=\"strong\"> situation</span> <li><span class=\"strong\"> le pass\u00e9 compos\u00e9</span> pour indiquer les <span class=\"strong\"> actions</span> et les <span class=\"strong\"> \u00e9v\u00e9nements</span> <li><span class=\"strong\"> le plus-que-parfait</span> pour rapporter les actions et les \u00e9v\u00e9nements qui pr\u00e9c\u00e8dent les faits de l'incident pour <span class=\"strong\"> marquer leur ant\u00e9riorit\u00e9</span>.<ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Le gar\u00e7on marchait quand la voiture est arriv\u00e9e. Le conducteur a essay\u00e9 de freiner, mais il \u00e9tait trop tard. La voiture a heurt\u00e9 le gar\u00e7on. Quand elle est arriv\u00e9e, l'accident avait d\u00e9j\u00e0 eu lieu. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Le conducteur qui avait percut\u00e9 le gar\u00e7on se disputait avec un groupe de gens un peu plus loin.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "\u00e9pouvantable, \u00e9pouvantable", "type": "name"}, {"content": "effrayant ; terrifiant ; terrible", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Coraline raconte quelque chose d'\u00e9pouvantable.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le09ob08aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "Voici des mots que vous pouvez employer pour parler des accidents routiers.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "encercler", "type": "name"}, {"content": "faire un cercle autour de quelqu'un ou quelque chose", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : La foule qui les encerclait.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le09ob08aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "saigner", "type": "name"}, {"content": "perdre du sang", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Le petit gar\u00e7on saignait \u00e0 la jambe.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le09ob08aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le tourniquet", "type": "name"}, {"content": "un appareil ou n\u0153ud utilis\u00e9 pour  arr\u00eater le saignement", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Il a bien ferm\u00e9 la blessure en faisant un tourniquet", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le09ob08aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "la d\u00e9chirure", "type": "name"}, {"content": "une ouverture irr\u00e9guli\u00e8re dans un tissu (humain ou non)", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : La d\u00e9chirure \u00e9tait caus\u00e9e par l'accident.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le09ob08aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "s'\u00e9tendre", "type": "name"}, {"content": "\u00eatre prolong\u00e9 d'un endroit \u00e0 l'autre ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Le Nil s'\u00e9tend de l'Afrique subsaharienne \u00e0 la m\u00e9diterran\u00e9e. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le09ob08aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le mollet", "type": "name"}, {"content": "une partie de la jambe entre le genou et la cheville", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Il y avait une grosse d\u00e9chirure qui s'\u00e9tendait de l'arri\u00e8re du genou jusqu'en bas du mollet. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le09ob08aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "percuter", "type": "name"}, {"content": "frapper ; heurter ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Le conducteur qui avait percut\u00e9 le gar\u00e7on se disputait avec un groupe de gens un peu plus loin.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le0